-# Z CVBN   x  m
+#QWERTYU O   ip
+#ASDFG J L k h
+# Z CVBN   x m
 # ^M is 13 that comes also at Enter, ^I is 9 that comes also at Tab
 # ^H at termux is 263 backspace
 # ^P at docker, something is not ok with the redraw
